  "description": "This collection comprises a total of 28 3 Tesla T1-weighted, T2-weighted, Diffusion weighted and Dynamic Contrast Enhanced prostate MRI along with accompanying digitized histopathology (H&Estained) images of corresponding radical prostatectomy specimens. Fused MATLAB objects are also provided combining both the MR and Pathology Images. Please see the Prostate Fused-MRI-Pathology wiki page to learn more about the images and to obtain any supporting metadata for this collection.",
